:{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/m34xrhmqj1is6d1v1jna3ed46","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"m34xrhmqj1is6d1v1jna3ed46","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/m34xrhmqj1is6d1v1jna3ed46","published_at":"2026-10-22T15:25:02Z","ref":"A4","score":77,"selected":true,"source":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","summary":"PHP2Shell 漏洞在被披露前四天已遭黑客利用，Calif 与 Wiz 的研究人员发现这些漏洞。OpenAI 称其前沿 AI 在攻击者之前发现了漏洞，并与 PHP、Calif、Wiz 合作验证并开发补丁。NSA 建议无法立即更新的机构将系统离线，英国 NCSC 表示漏洞可能让黑客无需登录凭据即可控制网站服务器，白宫称联邦机构正在评估对政府系统和关键基础设施的潜在影响。","title":"PHP2Shell 漏洞披露前黑客已有四天窗口，多国机构紧急响应","title_en":"Hackers got a four-day head start on epic PHP2Shell vulnerability","url":"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/10/hackers-got-a-four-day-head-start-on-epic-php2shell-vulnerability/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/pe2uqi2ny6l2lukrqzifbtyum","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"pe2uqi2ny6l2lukrqzifbtyum","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/pe2uqi2ny6l2lukrqzifbtyum","published_at":"2026-10-22T14:23:36Z","ref":"A5","score":82,"selected":true,"source":"404 Media（RSS）","summary":"404 Media 的 Jason Koebler 梳理近一个月安全专家对 AI 挖洞能力引发的\"Black October\"恐慌。Wiz、Calif 和 OpenAI 的研究者用 AI 发现了 PHP 的 PHP2Shell 漏洞，Cloudflare CEO 称公开公告前 10 小时已见数千次利用尝试，公告后 2 小时内增至数十万，目前达数百万级。","title":"404 Media 分析 PHP2Shell 事件如何改变 AI 时代的攻防格局","title_en":"AI Is Changing Everything About Hacking. No One Knows What Happens Next","url":"https://www.404media.co/php2shell-black-october-ai-is-changing-everything-about-hacking-no-one-knows-what-happens-next/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/fjyan16f0mvfywabd78m70hv3","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"fjyan16f0mvfywabd78m70hv3","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/fjyan16f0mvfywabd78m70hv3","published_at":"2026-10-22T14:02:33Z","ref":"A6","score":60,"selected":true,"source":"Sierra：Blog（RSS）","summary":"Sierra 发布 𝜏-Entity 基准，测量语音智能体能否正确采集、识别错误并修复姓名、电话号码、地址和邮箱等细节，包含 10 种实体类型共 200 个任务，并与 𝜏-i18n 一样覆盖六种语言。","title":"Sierra 发布 𝜏-Entity 基准，检验语音智能体能否准确采集姓名、电话等实体信息","title_en":"𝜏-Entity: Can voice agents get the details right?","url":"https://sierra.ai/blog/tau-entity-can-voice-agents-get-the-details-right"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/n6afjfxhq6vadobu4p0lm6tzm","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"n6afjfxhq6vadobu4p0lm6tzm","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/n6afjfxhq6vadobu4p0lm6tzm","published_at":"2026-10-22T13:05:31Z","ref":"A7","score":74,"selected":true,"source":"Wiz：Research（安全研究）","summary":"Wiz 披露 2026 年 10 月有攻击者使用开源自主渗透测试框架 ARTEX 针对多家 IT 和软件厂商，活动与微软报告的中国国家级关联组织 Storm-0940 重叠，并已扩展到其他软件领域的供应链攻击尝试。","title":"Wiz 披露 ARTEX 智能体被 Storm-0940 用于攻击 IT 和软件厂商","title_en":"ARTEX in the Wild: Storm-0940 Expands Targeting of IT and Software Vendors","url":"https://www.wiz.io/blog/artex-in-the-wild-storm-0940-expands-targeting-of-it-and-software-vendors"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/r557iovkk5v7ddt8py86ejctv","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"r557iovkk5v7ddt8py86ejctv","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/r557iovkk5v7ddt8py86ejctv","published_at":"2026-10-22T11:30:56Z","ref":"A8","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","summary":"Symantec 研究人员通过蜜罐截获一个把大语言模型嵌入核心的攻击智能体，它会劫持互联网上无防护的模型端点，自主扫描目标、利用服务器漏洞、窃取数据库凭据并安装挖矿程序，最多连续执行 100,000 步，算力费用由被劫持模型的主人承担。","title":"Symantec 披露“Skynet 模式”AI 智能体劫持无防护大语言模型发起自持续网络攻击","title_en":"An AI agent in \"Skynet mode\" hijacks unprotected language models to launch self-sustaining cyberattacks","url":"https://the-decoder.com/an-ai-agent-in-skynet-mode-hijacks-unprotected-language-models-to-launch-self-sustaining-cyberattacks/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/uc21c65s4trz2ums8g8fgtb0v","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"uc21c65s4trz2ums8g8fgtb0v","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/uc21c65s4trz2ums8g8fgtb0v","published_at":"2026-10-22T06:32:56Z","ref":"A9","score":67,"selected":true,"source":"X：可灵 Kling AI (@Kling_ai)","summary":"OpenArt 宣布 Kling 4.0 上线，可用首、中、尾帧引导视频，最多使用 10 张参考图，并支持文本或帧生成与视频编辑，All-in-One Reference 用一个模型完成生成和编辑。11 月 20 日前 Pro 和 Wonder 套餐享 50% 折扣。","title":"Kling 4.0 上线 OpenArt，支持首中尾帧引导与最多 10 张参考图","title_en":"Hold on to your hat. #KlingAI #Kling4","url":"https://x.com/Kling_ai/status/2113156632134005040"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/rin0ab4vdu46hjoiyjcj5vih5","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"rin0ab4vdu46hjoiyjcj5vih5","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/rin0ab4vdu46hjoiyjcj5vih5","published_at":"2026-10-22T05:36:40Z","ref":"A10","score":66,"selected":true,"source":"X：可灵 Kling AI (@Kling_ai)","summary":"可灵（Kling）宣布 Kling 4.0 已在 OnSolo 上线。该模型支持单次生成 30 秒原生视频，快速动作和大运镜下保持稳定，立体声配更准的口型同步，并提供 21:9 宽屏，单个任务可叠加最多 15 个参考图和 10 个关键帧以保持角色、镜头与剧情一致。","title":"Kling 4.0 现已上线 OnSolo","title_en":"Kling 4.0 is now live on OnSolo. #Kling4 #KlingAI","url":"https://x.com/Kling_ai/status/2113142473145078041"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/eme8i9igoadxb3beb902byfz0","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"eme8i9igoadxb3beb902byfz0","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/eme8i9igoadxb3beb902byfz0","published_at":"2026-10-22T05:13:16Z","ref":"A11","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","summary":"NSA 警告两个由 Calif 研究人员用 GPT-5.6 Sol 发现的 PHP 关键漏洞（PHP2Shell），敦促组织打补丁或将未修补服务器下线。两个漏洞位于 PHP 核心，在 Apache mod_php 上演示的利用可在应用代码运行前触发。","title":"NSA 就 AI 发现的 PHP2Shell 关键漏洞发布修复警告","title_en":"National Security Agency (NSA) and world leaders warn of security flaws found in PHP programming language","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2113136583985766442"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/nag5wgod0havrmodeo75pwnge","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"nag5wgod0havrmodeo75pwnge","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/nag5wgod0havrmodeo75pwnge","published_at":"2026-10-22T03:16:19Z","ref":"A12","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","summary":"WSJ 报道，马斯克希望以 AI 为核心将估值约 $2T 的 SpaceX 与约 $1.5T 的 Tesla 合并。SpaceX 的 AI 业务已成其最大业务，Q3 营收 $7.56B（一年前仅 $813M），季度 $19.6B 资本开支中超过 $16.4B 投向 AI，推动 SpaceX 实现季度利润 $4.4B（上年同期亏损 $1.05B）。","title":"WSJ：马斯克希望以 AI 为核心推动 SpaceX 与 Tesla 合并","title_en":"WSJ: Musk wants to combine a $2T rocket company with a $1.5T carmaker around AI.","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2113107154219741231"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/eud25k8zsrrwc63xp39ptvfah","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"eud25k8zsrrwc63xp39ptvfah","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/eud25k8zsrrwc63xp39ptvfah","published_at":"2026-10-22T03:13:00Z","ref":"A13","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","summary":"据 Bloomberg，DeepSeek 最新一轮融资约 150 亿美元，为中国最大规模私募融资之一。谈判期间融资目标至少两次上调，从约 75 亿美元提高到 120 亿美元；CATL 和腾讯是最大投资方之一，CATL 据报出资约 15 亿美元。投前估值约 748 亿美元，加上 6 月完成的首轮超 75 亿美元，DeepSeek 约 6 个月内共募资约 225 亿美元。","title":"Bloomberg 报道 DeepSeek 新一轮融资约 150 亿美元","title_en":"Bloomberg: DeepSeek has raised about $15B, one of China’s largest private financings.","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2113106318659928525"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/h1v8wxdkljwpiyadhmy7miw4x","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"h1v8wxdkljwpiyadhmy7miw4x","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/h1v8wxdkljwpiyadhmy7miw4x","published_at":"2026-10-22T02:33:39Z","ref":"A14","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"X：卡兹克 (@Khazix0918)","summary":"作者复盘 PHP2Shell 事件：两个 CVSS 满分定为 9.2 分的 PHP 远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2026-109618 和 CVE-2026-109619）在补丁发布前泄露，攻击演示视频外流，多国政府网站预防性下线，OpenAI 认领漏洞由 GPT-5.6 Sol 辅助发现。","title":"AI 挖出潜伏十几年的 PHP 底层漏洞，PHP2Shell 事件全景复盘","title_en":"AI挖出藏了十几年的底层PHP漏洞，网络安全也回不去那个旧时代了。","url":"https://x.com/Khazix0918/status/2113096414469464281"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/p6muwj8t5l4p2fcshu0tpzpek","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"p6muwj8t5l4p2fcshu0tpzpek","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/p6muwj8t5l4p2fcshu0tpzpek","published_at":"2026-10-22T02:17:14.247000Z","ref":"A15","s